{
  "comment": "Interim swap-ROM plan: Vickers FP left byte-identical; only the decided feature cuts applied. Every patch is a .bin assembled or generated for its target destination. Regions are cleared first (fill 0x00 = NOP keeps the divMMC automap addresses 04C6h/0562h benign); patches land on top. Boot banner version comes from VERSION (tools/genmsgtab.py); boot colours come from the colours block below (tools/gencolours.py). Build: tools/genmsgtab.py build/rompatch && python3 tools/gencolours.py rompatch/interim.json build/rompatch && ZENAS=... python3 tools/rompatch.py rompatch/interim.json",
